spell|raise-skeleton|wait_actor => Dark energy crackles along the bones, stripping away the last of their flesh. Something dry and purposeful stirs beneath your will...
spell|raise-spectre|cast_actor => You reach into the deep cold beneath these remains, searching for the heavy, hateful shadow of a powerful soul...
